 box near the restrooms. Our restrooms are cleaned regularly. Due to the damp Pacific Northwest climate, s", "st sit back and soak in the magic of the Milky Way. ⚡ EV Charging ⚡ Each site includes a standard 50-amp RV hookup, which may also be used for EV charging with your own adapters and equipment. EV charging is optional at $20 per night. Please note: power in Terlingua can be unreliable, and outages affecting the entire area are possible. Charging is not guaranteed and is offered at your own risk. Pets Electrical hookup", "pes of campsites. 1. Heated Clear Dome with queen bed and bedding. Includes private firepit, 1 vehicle and 2 people. Setting up an additional tent is allowed. 2. Vehicles only. No firepit. No tents. (Rooftop tent is ok) $20 3. Sites with Firepits allow vehicles and tents. $50 includes a firepit filled with firewood, 1 vehicle, 2 tents, 4 people. Additional firewood can be purchased for $7 a bundle. 4. Tent already se", "s only. No firepit. No tents. (Rooftop tent is ok) $20 3. Sites with Firepits allow vehicles and tents. $50 includes a firepit filled with firewood, 1 vehicle, 2 tents, 4 people. Additional firewood can be purchased for $7 a bundle. 4. Tent already set up. Heated Fall/Winter Camping (only 1 available) If yard maintenance, such as mowing or trimming is necessary during your stay, it will typically take place between 1", "Nantahala National Forest on Little Snowbird Creek in Robbinsville, NC. 16mi from Lake Santeelah, about 10mi from the Cherohala Skyway. MUST HAVE 4X4 OR AWD VEHICLE TO ACCESS MOUTAINTOP CAMPSITES. Property damage fee of $100 for 2WD vehicles not adhering to rule. 2WD vehicles must camp creekside, sites 1-6. NO AXES, HATCHETS, MACHETES ALLOWED ON THE PROPERTY. NO NAILS IN THE TREES TO HANG THINGS. It damages the tree ", "ate between 8am - 6pm daily during busy summer season. After that it is on an on-call basis in the off-peak season of October through April. 🌙 Quiet Hours: 10:00 PM – 7:00 AM ⚡ Vehicle charging 