r site clean and leave no trace. | · We do not currently recycle. Please do not leave recyclables outside dumpsters. | · No large household", "ay be disposed of in dumpsters. | ​ | Pets | · Pets must be leashed at all times. | · Pets may not be left unattended in RVs, cabins, or at campsites. | · Aggressive dogs are not allowed. | · Clean up after your pets. A $25 fee applies for waste left on site. | · Maximum of 2 dogs per site. | · Excessive barking is not permitted. | ​ | Check-In & Check-Out | · Check-in: 2:00 p.m. Please check in at the office/store b", "ulty. | · For arrivals after office hours (typically 5–6 p.m.), your site map and check-in info will be posted on the Check-In Board to the left of the office door. | · Check-out: 12:00 p.m. Late check-outs will incur a $25 fee charged to the card on file if still onsite after check out without approval from the office. | ​ | Laundry | · Open 8:00 a.m. to 9:00 p.m. Please do not leave clothing unattended. | · Quarter", " by an adult (18+). | ​ | Electric Vehicles | · EV charging is not permitted on site. | ​ | Cancellation & Refund Policy | · All reservations require prepayment. | · Non-holiday stays: 7-day notice for full refund minus $9. Less notice: 50% charge. No refund within 24 hours. | · Holiday stays: 14-day notice required (Friday before to Sunday after the holiday). | · $9 cancellation fee applies to all refunds. | · No-sh", "re prepayment. | · Non-holiday stays: 7-day notice for full refund minus $9. Less notice: 50% charge. No refund within 24 hours. | · Holiday stays: 14-day notice required (Friday before to Sunday after the holiday). | · $9 cancellation fee applies to all refunds. | · No-shows will be charged in full. | · Discounts and offers cannot be combined. | · No refunds for weather, insects, or other natural discomforts. | · No"], "via": "RATES & RULES"}, {"url": "https://www.chainolakescamp.com/campground", "lines": [], "via": "CAMPGROUND"}, {"url": "https://www.chainolakescamp.com/road-t